    "finalPromptText": "I'm working on a research paper for my information design class and I came across a reference to The Visual Display of Quantitative Information (1983) by Edward R. Tufte — it's apparently a foundational book on data visualization and statistical graphics. Can you help me find some background on this book and its author?",
